  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 513.17 Disabled Veteran Motorcycle Plate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 513.17 Disabled Veteran Motorcycle Plate.\n\n(a) Disabled veteran plates shall be issued to a vehicle registered pursuant to RSA 261:86.\n\n(b) Disabled veteran motorcycle plates shall:\n\n(1) Have the words “DISABLED VETERAN” on the upper border;\n\n(2) Have one to 4 alpha numerical characters; and\n\n(3) Have the statutorily-required universal symbol of accessibility.\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by 10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 514.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
